      "text": "[5:02PM] #Jibowu_Yaba #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Empire to Jibowu under bridge heading towards Herbert Macaulay Way down to Adekunle intersection, is currently smooth. This favorable condition extends to the return journey from Adekunle intersection to Makoko junction, Panti intersection and Alagomeji. \n\nApproaching Sabo is experiencing heavy traffic due to traffic light alternation. Similarly, the stretch from St. Agnes down to Unilag junction and Yaba Tech is busy due to ongoing road construction, while movement from WAEC down to Jibowu is slow. \n\nJibowu underneath the bridge in both inward and outward directions towards Empire is moving steadily, and traffic from Jibowu inward  Yaba Phase 1 and 2 is flowing faster. The stretch of Murtala Muhammad Way down to Oyingbo is in good condition, as is the flow from Oyingbo inward to Iddo via Otto and Oyingbo inward to Ile Ile.Kano Street inward from Apena Cemetery down to Adekunle is also clear. \n\nThere are no reported impediments, and our officers are actively managing traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
