      "text": "[5:25PM] #Lekki #TrafficUpdate \n\n Traffic flowing from Lekki roundabout, connecting Lekki peninsula gate, Fam City, Admiralty roundabout, Road 13 & 14, UBA/Admiralty road intersection, Zenith junction, Dome/Freedom way, and Itedo car wash is currently good. However, immediately after VFS down to Ikate gate, traffic is busy due to traffic alternation at Ikate. \n\nFor returning traffic, movement from Ikate gate, VFS, Itedo car wash, Dome/Freedom way connecting Zenith junction, UBA/Admiralty road, Road 14, and Road 13 & 14 is generally smooth. Admiralty roundabout en route the Link Bridge is experiencing slightly busy conditions due to the closing hour rush. \n\nThe Alexandra Link Bridge descending towards Admiralty roundabout is also busy due to the presence of a speed breaker bump. Access Junction towards Fam City is currently traffic-free.\n\n Conversely, movement immediately from Fam City inward Lekki peninsula gate down to Lekki roundabout is slightly busy due to the traffic light alternation at Lekki roundabout.\nOur personnel are well positioned at various identified congestion points. No traffic impediments are currently reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
