      "text": "[6:22PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow from UBA Roundabout and NNPC Filling Station towards Cathedral Church, with a good inward journey to Nitel Intersection.\nGood movement observed from State House connecting to Force Road.\nFast-moving traffic from Zone 2 Underneath Bridge towards Flagstaff House, inward McWen Bridge.\nPerfect traffic conditions from Onikan Roundabout towards TBS, with a smooth inward journey to Water Board, connecting to Nitel Intersection.\nAppreciable movement from General Hospital towards Tinubu Square, although approaching Abibu Oki Street by Martins Junction is experiencing slow movement due to congestion.\nImproved traffic flow immediately after Martins Junction inward to Apongbon.\nFast-moving traffic on the stretch of Igbosere Road and Catholic Mission Street, connecting to Ganiu Smith Street.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
